      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I wanted to use `otacerts_zip` with `recovery_available: true,` but not with `recovery: true,`, I didn\u0027t check the case for `recovery: true,`.\nThis is a correct change for a recovery variant of `recovery_available: true,` module to have `.recovery` suffix; while `recovery: true,` module doesn\u0027t.\nHowever, if you don\u0027t allow image mutation with `recovery_available`, you may remove `ImageInterface` from the `otacertsZipModule` with the `Recovery_available` property. And then, this if-clause can be removed.\nBut were there any problem on using the image mutation in `otacerts_zip` module?",
