      "writtenOn": "2024-12-09T18:03:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There were no specific problems regarding the image mutation itself; the issue is that `otacerts.recovery` is being installed in the recovery partition via `PRODUCT_PACKAGES`, and given that `otacerts.recovery` is a Soong-generated Androidmk module it is not possible for the Soong generated filesystem module to depend on `otacerts.recovery`. This is not an issue specific to `otacerts.recovery`, but for multiple modules that are installing to recovery partition via `recovery_available` property instead of defining a dedicated module for recovery partition.\n\nGiven that there is no use cases of image mutation for `otacerts_zip` module, I will remove this in the follow up change.",
